Drop non-bundled cosmetic assets here for the composite templates:

  back-classic.jpg    Classic Purple card back (Supabase cosmetic-assets/card-backs/back_classic.jpg)
  back-whiskered.jpg  Whiskered deck back (cosmetic-assets/decks/deck_cats/card-back.jpg or similar)
  back-moonlit.jpg    Moonlit Lore back
  table-velvet.jpg    Velvet table texture (cosmetic-assets/tables/table_velvet.jpg)
  table-marble.jpg    Marble table texture
  table-starry.jpg    Starry Night table texture
  fx-sparks.png       Golden Sparks flip effect overlay (optional)

These are tracked in git so the dashed-box fallback in the templates
points to a real (empty) directory, but the actual *.jpg / *.png
files are gitignored (large binaries — keep out of the legal repo).
